From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tgmeinde <tgmeinde@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 17:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] so_arm101: publish the gripper effort

The console's gripper-current meter reads the gripper's effort on
/joint_states. The joint state broadcaster only publishes the state
interfaces the hardware exports, so the gripper exports effort.
Position control stays the command.

---

diff --git a/so_arm101_description/control/so_arm101.ros2_control.xacro b/so_arm101_description/control/so_arm101.ros2_control.xacro
index ec96c38..fcf9299 100644
--- a/so_arm101_description/control/so_arm101.ros2_control.xacro
+++ b/so_arm101_description/control/so_arm101.ros2_control.xacro
@@ -91,6 +91,8 @@
         <command_interface name="position" />
         <state_interface name="position" />
         <state_interface name="velocity" />
+        <!-- The gripper-current meter reads this. Position control stays the command. -->
+        <state_interface name="effort" />
       </joint>
     </ros2_control>
   </xacro:macro>
